{"4295600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Depono", "steam_appid": 4295600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depono is a competitive PvP strategy card game built around deck-building, betting, and bluffing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/23f8a488f811e67e53393187308f23e9.poster.avif?t=1787873835\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/23f8a488f811e67e53393187308f23e9.webm?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/23f8a488f811e67e53393187308f23e9.mp4?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match challenges you to build a stronger deck, manage a limited supply of chips, and out-think your opponents across a series of high-stakes rounds. Use your chips to buy boosts and items to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your hand and watch the cards go head-to-head. The highest card wins, but what items and tricks are your opponents hiding? Select items from the shop to get an edge and level the playing field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/e322ed88b7fa05df0be6bffb4e34e64e.poster.avif?t=1787873835\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/e322ed88b7fa05df0be6bffb4e34e64e.webm?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/e322ed88b7fa05df0be6bffb4e34e64e.mp4?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only 3 cards per round, how much can you game the system? Pack in bonuses with special items and unique cards, but don't spend too much, or you might end up losing your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in long enough to secure the win. Zero out and you're gone. The goal is simple: survive longer than every other player, become the last player standing, and claim the pot. Go all in, will you lose it all, or win it big?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/6c428ac11909c279a438b2338a55319a.poster.avif?t=1787873835\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/6c428ac11909c279a438b2338a55319a.webm?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/6c428ac11909c279a438b2338a55319a.mp4?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy round after round as the game changes. Decide how much you want to bet, and hope your opponents don't have a trump card. Win the game and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each win moves you up the leader-board, and each loss sends you hurtling back down. Reach the top and become the all-time champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/f689d0f392518305a16735810000fb51.poster.avif?t=1787873835\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/f689d0f392518305a16735810000fb51.webm?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/f689d0f392518305a16735810000fb51.mp4?t=1787873835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depono Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive PvP card battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check, raise, fold, and bluffing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A constantly changing game board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus cards and match-changing items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip-based match buy-ins and rewards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked competitive progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>DEPONO IS NOT REAL GAMBLING!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depono does not use real money for matches and will never ask you for money. We have no micro-transactions (even for cosmetics). All money in the game is purely fictional.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depono is a competitive PvP strategy card game built around deck-building, betting, and bluffing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/extras/23f8a488f811e67e53393187308f23e9.poster.avif?t=1787873835\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a