<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check, raise, fold, and bluffing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A constantly changing game board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus cards and match-changing items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip-based match buy-ins and rewards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked competitive progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>DEPONO IS NOT REAL GAMBLING!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depono does not use real money for matches and will never ask you for money. We have no micro-transactions (even for cosmetics). All money in the game is purely fictional.</p>", "short_description": "Play against your friends in this fast paced, competitive card game. Bet, scheme and bluff your way to victory. Craft your deck with secret cards, change the playing field with items and become unstoppable.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/550b8ab4a6dd8d1bf2bf19cd9bfc1a29f6bd4d21/header.jpg?t=1787873835", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/cb234f2203948375a44ae39abefdf0bac88eabab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787873835", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295600/cb234f2203948375a44ae39abefdf0bac88eabab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787873835", "website": "https://ikastudios.com/games/Depono", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern 